  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m03-s001",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 8200,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Morning all. Quick one today, I want to go account by account and then talk about the meeting slot itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s002",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 8450,
      "endMs": 14370,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Before accounts, can we fix the slot? Mondays keep colliding with client steering calls."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s003",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-b",
      "startMs": 14620,
      "endMs": 20160,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Same for me. Wednesday mornings are almost always free for the whole team."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s004",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 20410,
      "endMs": 24050,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Any objections to moving this sync to Wednesdays?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s005",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-d",
      "startMs": 24300,
      "endMs": 27560,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "None, Wednesday is better for me too."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s006",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 27810,
      "endMs": 32970,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Okay, decided, from next week the weekly sync moves to Wednesday mornings."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s007",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 33220,
      "endMs": 39520,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great. Accounts then. Northwind is fine, the pilot kicked off well and Sarah seems happy."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s008",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 39770,
      "endMs": 47210,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Agreed. Halden is also moving, JJ is on the migration and the license deadline is keeping everyone focused."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s009",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-b",
      "startMs": 47460,
      "endMs": 55280,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Speaking of staffing, just so everyone knows, we're under a hiring freeze until March. No new reqs until then."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s010",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 55530,
      "endMs": 59550,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That's going to hurt if the Corvid work grows."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s011",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 59800,
      "endMs": 65720,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Let's make sure it doesn't grow faster than we can staff it. Nadia, Corvid?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s012",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-d",
      "startMs": 65970,
      "endMs": 74170,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The intake discovery workshop with Corvid is next week. I'll share the first intake wireframes with you before the workshop."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s013",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 74420,
      "endMs": 79200,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Perfect, send them by Tuesday so I can read them properly."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s014",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-d",
      "startMs": 79450,
      "endMs": 81190,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Will do, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s015",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-b",
      "startMs": 81440,
      "endMs": 88120,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "And Nadia, as your manager I'm happy to review them too before they go to Alex."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s016",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-b",
      "startMs": 88370,
      "endMs": 96190,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Unrelated, but AI code review came up again in the engineering channel. It keeps coming up every few weeks."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s017",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 96440,
      "endMs": 102740,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "It does. We should probably look into that at some point, but not this month."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s018",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 102990,
      "endMs": 107010,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Agreed, there's no appetite for tooling changes right now."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s019",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-b",
      "startMs": 107260,
      "endMs": 111280,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll just keep noting it when it comes up."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s020",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 111530,
      "endMs": 114410,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Hana, anything from the commercial side?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s021",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 114660,
      "endMs": 125520,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Only that I'm going to be a bit slower on email on Friday mornings, I'm training for the Lisbon half marathon and my long runs are Friday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s022",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 125770,
      "endMs": 128650,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good luck with that. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s023",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-d",
      "startMs": 128900,
      "endMs": 134820,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Can we get Corvid access sorted before the workshop? I need their brand guidelines."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s024",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-c",
      "startMs": 135070,
      "endMs": 137950,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll ask Elif for them today."
    },
    {
      "id": "m03-s025",
      "speakerId": "m03-spk-a",
      "startMs": 138200,
      "endMs": 142220,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great, I think that's everything. See you all Wednesday."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Larkspur weekly delivery sync\n\n**Date:** January 22\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera, Priya Raman, Hana Sato, Nadia Brooks\n\n## Summary\n\nInternal weekly sync covering the meeting slot, account health across Northwind, Halden and Corvid, staffing, and a recurring tooling topic.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- The weekly delivery sync moves to **Wednesday mornings**, starting next week, because Mondays collide with client steering calls.\n\n## Accounts\n\n- **Northwind Robotics** — the pick-path pilot kicked off well and Sarah seems happy.\n- **Halden Freight** — JJ is on the migration; the license deadline is keeping everyone focused.\n- **Corvid Health** — the intake discovery workshop is next week.\n\n## Staffing\n\nLarkspur is under a hiring freeze until March, with no new reqs until then. Hana flagged that this could hurt if the Corvid work grows.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Nadia Brooks** — share the first intake wireframes with Alex before the Corvid workshop, by Tuesday.\n- **Hana Sato** — ask Elif at Corvid for their brand guidelines today.\n\n## Other topics\n\n- AI code review came up again in the engineering channel; it resurfaces every few weeks. Nobody took it on — \"we should probably look into that at some point\", but not this month.\n- Hana will be slower on email on Friday mornings while she trains for the Lisbon half marathon.\n"
  },
